[{"title":"静中感怀","author":"胡居仁","text":"物我难容一发私，岂论谁是与谁非。\n人心固是参天地，百计劳劳只自卑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50854,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"礼吾书院","author":"胡居仁","text":"卜筑礼吾山水胜，清幽期与古人伦。\n人言此地诚孤野，我亦肯为孤野人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50855,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日即事","author":"胡居仁","text":"不是区区功与利，亦非窈窈与冥冥。\n荒源也有沂泉乐，茂对春和看物生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50856,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"倦后偶成","author":"胡居仁","text":"工夫未至力先疲，才罢吾伊细咏诗。\n暂借馀閒养情性，莫将过苦败身躯。\n圣经浩博有馀味，人事纷纭无尽期。\n羸却当年陶处士，萧然一枕卧皇羲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50857,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"礼吾书院","author":"胡居仁","text":"自古多贤仰鲁邦，儒风今喜振吾乡。\n礼吾一段荒閒地，翻作弦歌礼义场。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50858,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜罾鱼奉亲","author":"胡居仁","text":"王祥孝感出双鳞，更有姜诗善事亲。\n何事今人不如古，终宵举网向溪滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50859,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉吴先生二首次于先生韵 其一","author":"胡居仁","text":"数仞师门力学真，明乎庶物察人伦。\n芳塘活水今犹昔，喜际龙潭复有人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50860,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉吴先生二首次于先生韵 其二","author":"胡居仁","text":"抱膝茅檐盖世豪，管教得志失萧曹。\n登攀自是男儿志，谁道龙门特自高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50861,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同于先生绝句","author":"胡居仁","text":"投装野寺爱幽栖，翠竹苍梧趣正宜。\n久坐檐楹师弟子，清风明月更输谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50862,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行至四龙冈绝句","author":"胡居仁","text":"四龙冈上记行踪，往复师门九载中。\n每愧光阴虚度也，从头重拟更加功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50863,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陪于先生璿兄戴子静游石泉","author":"胡居仁","text":"淡日凉风雨乍收，赐金田畔纵遐游。\n数声渔笛閒听罢，人意清和泉石幽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50864,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和于先生韵","author":"胡居仁","text":"菾操几杖罢遗编，踏遍青山看石泉。\n多士优游涵教雨，群黎歌舞乐尧天。\n家家绿树山到屋，处处青苗水满田。\n日月真腴非外得，此心肯为利名牵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50865,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠友人宁寿","author":"胡居仁","text":"后生诚可畏，积学实难量。\n养正功宜豫，家庭笃义方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50866,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又读书林閒","author":"胡居仁","text":"劳劳曾可似閒閒，日月携书到处看。\n好是薰风惬人意，时来林下整衣冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50867,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看东山书屋旧趾","author":"胡居仁","text":"十年勤苦读书心，绿树阴中认故岑。\n成已功难增永叹，愚蒙空数岁华深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50868,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼农","author":"胡居仁","text":"四民共处九围间，农父何曾一日閒。\n想彼锦衣并玉食，岂知稼穑甚艰难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50869,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居即事","author":"胡居仁","text":"虚堂村落里，环堵任萧然。\n细草连阶石，香茶煮涧泉。\n青山朝过雨，绿树晚含烟。\n日用无馀事，工夫付简编。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50870,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和","author":"胡居仁","text":"寂寞虚堂里，琴书共晏然。\n饥炊野田粟，渴饮石溪泉。\n清淡四檐月，氤氲半篆烟。\n圣贤名教外，细玩杜陵编。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50871,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"往山下石岩醉卧成诗三首 其一","author":"胡居仁","text":"浓酒三杯后，颓然卧石岩。\n清风生野树，绿水满寒潭。\n素履心无外，豪吟意正酣。\n是非毋自质，付与世人谈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50872,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"往山下石岩醉卧成诗三首 其二","author":"胡居仁","text":"浮云满长空，閒客醉岩中。\n不学丹砂术，何劳问葛洪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50873,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"往山下石岩醉卧成诗三首 其三","author":"胡居仁","text":"寂寞空山里，堪舆即枕衾。\n遥怜李学士，踪迹杳难寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50874,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看鸟三首 其一","author":"胡居仁","text":"幽禽碧树里，何事不予惊。\n孔子不射宿，拳拳素服膺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50875,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看鸟三首 其二","author":"胡居仁","text":"漫向幽岩学养真，青山绿水隔红尘。\n虽然仰面贪看鸟，也未回头错应人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50876,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看鸟三首 其三","author":"胡居仁","text":"藤萝幽树覆岩端，岩下清泉九夏寒。\n敢效南阳称八达，肃然起坐正衣冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50877,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听松琴","author":"胡居仁","text":"清风满树生，恍若伯牙情。\n虽无钟子期，山岩人细听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50878,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵奉于先生","author":"胡居仁","text":"事道拳拳数梦周，好将仁义作居由。\n他年慰满苍生望，野服黄冠任退休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50879,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"琴后绝句","author":"胡居仁","text":"柳影槐阴昼景长，北窗閒客在羲皇。\n素琴一曲知音少，坐对南薰满篆香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50880,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和许郢州中秋玩月","author":"胡居仁","text":"当空一鉴正团圆，万里青宵散紫烟。\n秋气清明当永夜，晴光皎洁满中天。\n苍松影转虚窗外，丹桂香分丈席前。\n但喜好怀无所累，何妨玩赏自年年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50881,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和朱子韵","author":"胡居仁","text":"圣贤警示意非轻，要为斯人正性情。\n三复服膺增悚惧，昏愚只恐是虚生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50882,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读书自感","author":"胡居仁","text":"频复多由志不强，七情胜处失闲防。\n身心自觉沈沦久，羞读颜渊好学章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50883,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夜吟","author":"胡居仁","text":"雨雪潇潇值岁除，奉亲才暇更观书。\n明朝又复更年月，拟用新功涤旧污。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50884,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正旦入斋","author":"胡居仁","text":"庆罢新年一乐馀，携书踏雪到精庐。\n工夫自此宜加励，岁月虚过更咎谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50885,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪夜偶成","author":"胡居仁","text":"寒窗清苦孰能禁，为访梅花踏雪寻。\n读罢轲书长闭户，静中又复得存心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50886,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中访友","author":"胡居仁","text":"竹户常扃雪满窗，书程日紧用功忙。\n今朝特发山阴兴，只为金兰契谊长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50887,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元宵夜吟","author":"胡居仁","text":"茅庵似斗宽，亦喜堪容膝。\n读罢更閒眠，养心宜静密。\n灯火何处多，笙歌闹谁室。\n迷子何太欢，跋报为甚疾。\n却怜山间人，幽独穷且室。\n读书嫌性愚，旧记多忘失。\n吟诗苦才悭，不能精格律。\n倦卧似无聊，幸不违心术。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50888,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒中寓意","author":"胡居仁","text":"门外青山拂翠烟，野堂人事总萧然。\n案头旧典两三帙，囊里新诗四五联。\n克念不妨能作圣，怠荒何日可希贤。\n括囊夙有遗经训，何苦名缰万里牵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50889,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"去年此日被风雨倒墙兼绝食","author":"胡居仁","text":"去岁墙倾更绝粮，今年净几与明窗。\n人生苦乐何须计，流水行云语意长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50890,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"劳中迷事","author":"胡居仁","text":"服劳安敢便宁居，困厄无端智力疲。\n性外固非心所急，日间自有义当为。\n自强愿法天行健，昏妄那堪已性愚。\n从古宴安如酖毒，春冰虎尾忽忘危。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50891,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乘舟","author":"胡居仁","text":"新水涟漪宿雨收，泛舟直下锦溪头。\n好风四至清衣袂，信有长江五月秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50892,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽表兄刘毅 其一","author":"胡居仁","text":"总总谁无死与生，英雄准拟立功名。\n一枝丹桂虽残燬，尚有千秋万载馨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50893,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽表兄刘毅 其二","author":"胡居仁","text":"雄文鏖战气方豪，谁料烟炎烬俊髦。\n信道青云难力致，东山不是谢安高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50894,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日即事","author":"胡居仁","text":"槐柳阴阴满户庭，画帘高捲午风轻。\n数篇书卷前贤业，一曲瑶琴太古情。\n心在静时无杂扰，事当几处最分明。\n从来实行难充溢，只恐虚名误此生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50895,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中自感","author":"胡居仁","text":"风雨篷窗不昧时，客中情绪总依依。\n静思成已功难处，私意才行行即亏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50896,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢程子","author":"胡居仁","text":"整齐严肃问明教，直内工夫尚有疑。\n入到湛然虚静处，始知夫子不吾欺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50897,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自述","author":"胡居仁","text":"终日观书，圣贤在目。\n终日言谈，不及利禄。\n若使荑稗不生，何愁五谷不熟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50898,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新秋偶成","author":"胡居仁","text":"丈夫志匪为身谋，经纶不展便当收。\n浮云满空我不管，碧峰头上卧新秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50899,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自叹","author":"胡居仁","text":"古今惟一理，贤否自殊科。\n颜子乐无闷，吾何悔吝多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50900,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自叹以遗人","author":"胡居仁","text":"操存腔里心，酬应世閒事。\n世人不知此，只去学文字。\n终日清明方是敬，一时杂扰便成昏。\n知行由此作基本，便是程朱入道门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50901,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"叹学者","author":"胡居仁","text":"这里路长嫌担重，那边快捷实崎岖。\n行人不知著脚处，东跋西跋多受亏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50902,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读明道伊川学制","author":"胡居仁","text":"孟轲没后道随亡，教化真如一梦长。\n不向心中求六德，只来纸上耀三场。\n先生欲扫千年陋，后学那能一日忘。\n愿得天心回古意，更令斯世绍先王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50903,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"胡居仁","text":"人心无物欲，随处皆天理。\n在山则乐山，在水则乐水。\n在家则家齐，在国则国治。\n在学则学明，在乡风俗美。\n窃叹此等人，岂不为至贵。\n彼哉昏迷子，何为欲所蔽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50904,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"团湖怀古","author":"胡居仁","text":"闻说团湖古战场，宋元此地决兴亡。\n谢公忠义昭千古，兴者已亡亡未亡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50905,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"存心","author":"胡居仁","text":"冲漠无朕内，万象自森然。\n堪叹虚无子，悬空学圣贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50906,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自存","author":"胡居仁","text":"夜雨山窗梦不成，细思旧业转惺惺。\n致知幸免多昏塞，行已深惭未尽诚。\n坠绪茫茫何日续，流风靡靡几时兴。\n信知大本元无二，活水源头见考亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50907,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢本府太守二首 其一","author":"胡居仁","text":"白屋正惭无孺子，黄堂岂是少陈蕃。\n莞然上下忘其势，留取高风万古看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50908,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢本府太守二首 其二","author":"胡居仁","text":"以贵下贱大得民，一郡蔼然周化盛。\n刍言敢献到黄堂，不忍心行不忍政。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50909,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自勉二首 其一","author":"胡居仁","text":"周南治化何其盛，本在身脩与意诚。\n此是圣贤真事业，莫教墙面度平生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50910,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自勉二首 其二","author":"胡居仁","text":"此身此理由天付，屋漏多惭忝所生。\n今后事天知有道，力闲邪妄便存诚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50911,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"叹古人读书二首 其一","author":"胡居仁","text":"圣贤文字传千载，不遇程朱怎柰何。\n刺股悬梁辛苦志，其如一敬得功多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50912,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"叹古人读书二首 其二","author":"胡居仁","text":"刺股悬梁枉自勤，岂知心在检其身。\n只因未遇程夫子，苦杀当年多少人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50913,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"勉学者","author":"胡居仁","text":"静对遗经玩困亨，忧勤重悯四三生。\n一偏廉介非难守，全体中庸不可能。\n高世好坚徐孺操，劳家且学董生耕。\n题诗本欲资名教，岂为区区寄俗情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50914,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送徐生归","author":"胡居仁","text":"梅放寒花岁已深，为君特赋雪窗吟。\n信知此道无今古，展卷详论孔孟心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50915,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠超元弼","author":"胡居仁","text":"功名不是吾儒事，王道根基在自新。\n目下升高当远步，莫教对塔说相轮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50916,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观易偶成","author":"胡居仁","text":"阴阳消长不停机，在我何常无定规。\n否极中间存大用，遁临已上识先几。\n尧夫因甚怕处盛，正叔如何善救危。\n幸有羲周精蕴在，安身不必打乖诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50917,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"碧峰书院","author":"胡居仁","text":"碧霄峰下搆幽斋，中寓琴书惬素怀。\n信是心虚涵万理，更欣地僻绝纤埃。\n蓁芜径路由斯辟，圣学门庭自此开。\n欲识工夫真切处，好从博约竭渊才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50918,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辞谢南康府学官","author":"胡居仁","text":"薄德何堪古道看，延留连日谢儒官。\n天心若欲兴斯道，莫叹人生会晤难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50919,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再游龟峰二首 其一","author":"胡居仁","text":"路达龟峰本不遐，汎舟反复傍溪涯。\n如何吃尽多劳扰，只为源头一步差。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50920,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再游龟峰二首 其二","author":"胡居仁","text":"不道吾心识未真，妄将指点误傍人。\n惕然到此方知省，敦复真能胜似频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50921,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诚意关","author":"胡居仁","text":"谨独功深切，防微意最玄。\n争交真在此，要不愧皇天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50922,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"胡居仁","text":"辋川清致贪看竹，湖上林公好咏梅。\n问我寒窗何所事，关闽濂洛意徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50923,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"叹雉死","author":"胡居仁","text":"汝能耿介全天性，竟日凄凉感慨深。\n始识先王真礼意，男儿安敢负斯心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50924,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"胡居仁","text":"万理具涵方寸内，只从此处作经纶。\n要知希圣无他法，去尽私心德自纯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50925,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松","author":"胡居仁","text":"一夜风霜万木枯，岁寒惟见老松孤。\n秦皇不识清高操，强欲烦君作大夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50926,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题濂溪旧隐","author":"胡居仁","text":"绀寒清洁古濂溪，缅想当年有道居。\n学贯天人纯性命，理原大极著图书。\n光风霁月心无累，胜水佳山意有馀。\n香郁溪连庭草翠，圣贤高致后人庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50927,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日即事","author":"胡居仁","text":"绿树阴中日正长，黑甜人世在羲皇。\n有朋时共谈今古，漫说伊周治世方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50928,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日书怀","author":"胡居仁","text":"礼吾地僻聚儒衣，三尺丝桐满架书。\n细草幽兰秋径馥，清风明月夜窗虚。\n固知圣教元无隐，惟有人心却是危。\n记取当年箪食乐，残蝉斜日任悲凄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50929,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]